      779     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('gtd', '', '',   input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
      780     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('country', '', '', input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
