      814       if b-mark:sensitive then apply "choose" to b-mark in frame Dialog-Frame.
      815       else                     apply "choose" to b-sel in frame Dialog-Frame.
      816     else if b-lookup:sensitive then apply "choose" to b-lookup in frame Dialog-Frame.
      817   END.
